Implement the Verilog module based on the following description.
Build a 2-bit binary counter with synchronous active high reset signal and enable signal.
// (1) reset: Resets the counter to zero.
// (2) enable: Enables or disables counting.
// (3) q: The value of the counter.

module binary_counter_2bit(
